  "question": {
    "text": "An athlete, initially at rest, takes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> to reach his maximum speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The magnitude of his average acceleration (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-2</mo></mrow></msup></math>) is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The final speed of the athlete,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>initial speed,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>time taken&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mpadded lspace=\"-1px\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mpadded></math></p><p>for average acceleration,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
